# Peios glibc patch series — applied in order by pekit during source
# materialisation ([source].patches in pekit.toml).
#
# glibc carried no Peios patches until this one, and the bar for adding to that
# should stay high: every patch here is a rebase on every glibc release, on the
# most security-critical library on the system. This one clears it because the
# property it establishes cannot be established anywhere else.
nss/identity-is-not-configurable.patch   # identity comes from the authority, and from nowhere a config file can name
